          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "four mouths. all dead."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 15.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "processed until the words dissolve."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 22.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "axiom: there are four voices."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 28.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "Voice_1: 100\u2013500 Hz. energy 4.12."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 34.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the floor beneath the floorboards."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 40.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "Voice_4: 3000\u20138000 Hz. metallic."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 46.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the ringing in the narrator's ears."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 54.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "cross-correlation, Voice_2 \u00d7 Voice_3: 0.579."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 60.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "they fight in the same territory."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 66.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "Voice_1 \u00d7 Voice_4: 0.213."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 72.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the heartbeat and the ringing. nearly independent."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 82.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "centroid: 3264 Hz."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 88.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "but the weight is below."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 94.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "sub-bass: -24.8 dB. dominant by 10 dB."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 101.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "a compression algorithm would have trouble deciding."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 112.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "597 heartbeats."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 118.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "mean inter-beat: 1.34 seconds."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 124.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "this is not a composed rhythm."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 130.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "this is what happens when four people read at different speeds."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 142.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the pulse is real."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 148.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "it is measurable."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 153.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "it was not written."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 165.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "dominant period: 2.937 seconds."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 172.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "20.4 BPM. the deep breathing."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 180.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "but there is a faster rhythm hidden inside it."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 188.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "0.654 Hz. 39.2 BPM."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 195.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the amplitude modulation frequency."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 205.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "modulation depth: 0.54."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 212.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "over half the signal shaped by what voices do to each other."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 220.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "this is the tell-tale heart."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 226.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "it was never composed."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 232.0,
          "duration_sec": 2.5,
          "text": "it emerged."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 242.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "here is where the proof begins to fail."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 255.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "opening: modulation depth 0.60."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 262.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "four fresh rhythms. strong interference."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 270.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "by 1:30 it drops to 0.40."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 276.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the voices are settling."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 282.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the beating should stop."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 293.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "it does not stop."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 305.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "by 4:00 the depth climbs back to 0.55."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 312.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the text has changed the voices."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 320.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "Poe's prose accelerates. the sentences shorten."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 328.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "each performer responds differently."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 336.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "the meaning of the words is driving the interference."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 350.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "the system cannot predict this from the signal alone."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 365.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "6:00. modulation spike: 0.64."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 380.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "onset density: 5.6 per second."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 395.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "something approaching."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 415.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the voices are diverging again."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 435.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the proof verifier cannot formalize this."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 460.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "semantic content drives spectral behavior."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 468.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "four nervous systems between input and output."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 490.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the mapping requires knowledge outside the system."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 510.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the heartbeat passage is coming."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 535.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "centroid holding at 3398 Hz."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 555.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "\"a low, dull, quick sound.\""
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 562.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "one lingers. one rushes. one whispers."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 568.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "one leans on the consonants."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 575.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "modulation depth: 0.70."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 582.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the peak."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 588.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "the hidden heartbeat is loudest here."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 596.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "precisely when the words describe hearing it."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 608.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the proof of the heartbeat requires the heartbeat."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 615.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the theorem references itself."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 630.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "this is the incompleteness."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 650.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "41.9 dB of dynamic range."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 658.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "4256 onsets across 800 seconds."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 675.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "approaching the confession."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 700.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the voices are converging."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 706.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "interference becoming constructive."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 720.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the pulse, for the first time, is not hidden."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 740.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "RMS: 0.093. nearly double."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 748.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "the heartbeat is the whole signal."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 762.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "597 heartbeats. belonging to no one."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 770.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "composed by no one."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 780.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.5,
          "text": "emerging from the space between four dead voices."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 790.0,
          "duration_sec": 3.0,
          "text": "the pulse proves itself."
        },
        {
          "time_sec": 796.0,
          "duration_sec": 4.0,
          "text": "the proof is incomplete."
        }
      ]
    }
